!endif

tmp0=!randint 1, 4

val6=$[rint($(tmp0))]
tmp0=!randint 2, 5

val7=$[rint($(tmp0))]
tmp=!trim 4,1,4,1	4,2,4,4	4,3,4,5	4,4,4,10
val8=!translate internal $	\
$ to ;; in $tmp
val9=$[$(val8[$val6;1])]
t_=!rawmath $(val8[$val6;2])
val10=!exec pari print($t_)
val11=$[rint($(val8[$val6;3]))]
val12=$[rint($(val8[$val6;4]))]
val13=$[rint($val10*$val11/$val9)]
val14=$[rint($val11+$val13)]
val15=$[$val10*$val11^2]
val16=$[rint($val15+$val9*$val13^2)]
val17=$[sqrt($val16/$val9)]
val18=$[$val14+$val17]
val19=$[rint($val14+$val7)]
val20=!rawmath $val10*x^2+sqrt(x)*0+sqrt($val11+0.05-x)*0
val21=!rawmath -$val9*x^2+$val16+sqrt(x+$val13-0.02)*0+sqrt($val17+0.01-x)*0
val22=!rawmath -$val9*(x-$val14)^2+$val16+sqrt(x-$val11+0.02)*0+sqrt($val18+0.015-x)*0
val23=!rawmath $val10*(x-$val7)^2
val24=!rawmath -$val9*(x-$val19)^2+$val16
val25=!rawmath $val10*(x-$val7)^2+sqrt(x-$val7+0.05)*0+sqrt($val11+$val7+0.05-x)*0
val26=!rawmath -$val9*(x-$val19)^2+$val16+sqrt(x-$val11-$val7+0.05)*0+sqrt($val18+$val7+0.02-x)*0
val27=$[rint(-$val13-1)]
val28=$[rint(25+$val27)]
val29=$[rint(-(floor($val16/10)+1))]
val30=$[rint(1.125*$val16)]
val31=!rawmath -$val9*(x-$val14)^2+$val16
t_=!replace internal \( by ( in expand($val31)
tmp0=!exec maxima $t_

val32=!rawmath $(tmp0)
val33=$[rint(2*$val9*$val14)]
val34=$[rint($val9*($val14^2)-$val16)]
val35=!rawmath -$val9*x^2+$val33*x-$val34
val36=(0.5*animstep-$val13)
val37=text black,-$val13-0.2,-0.2,small,-$val13
!for val38  = 1 to 20  
val37=$val37	text black,$val38-0.2,-0.2,small,$val38
!next
val39=$[rint($val16/$val9)]
val40=sqrt($val39)
val41=$val14+$val40
val42=$val19+$val40
val43=
!for val38  = $val12 to $val30-2 step $val12 
val43=$val43 ; text black,-1.2,$val38+0.4*$val12,small,$val38
!next
val44=xrange $val27,$val28	yrange $val29,$val30	linewidth 1	parallel $val27,0,$val27,$val30,1,0,$val28+3,lightblue	parallel $val27,$val12,$val28,$val12,0,$val12,$val30,lightblue	text black,0.5,$val30,medium,altitude en m	text black,$val28-4.5,$val12,medium,temps en s	linewidth 2	arrow $val27,0,$val28,0,10, black	arrow 0,$val29,0,$val30,10, black	text black $val27,-$val13,medium,- $val13	$val37	$val43	plotsteps 1000	text green,0.8*$val13,$val12,medium,c	text black,0.8*$val13,$val16-$val12,medium,r	plot green,$val20	plot black,$val21	
val45=$val44	plot red,$val22	text red,$val14,$val16-$val12,medium,g	
val46=animate 2*$val17+2*$val13+1,1,0	$val45	linewidth 2	arrow $val36,$val16-$val9*$val36^2,$val36+$val14,$val16-$val9*$val36^2,10,black	text black,$val36-0.2,0.5*$val29,medium,x-$val14	text black,$val36+$val14-0.2,0.5*$val29,medium,x	dsegment $val36,0,$val36,$val16-$val9*$val36^2,black	dsegment $val36+$val14,0,$val36+$val14,$val16-$val9*$val36^2,black	
val47=animate 2*$val17+2*$val13+1,1,0	$val44	plot red,$val22	plot green,$val25	plot red,$val26	text red,$val14,$val16-3,medium,g	text red,$val19,$val16-3,medium,u	text green,$val7+$val13,$val12,medium,f	linewidth 2	arrow $val36+$val14,$val16-$val9*$val36^2,$val36+$val14+$val7,$val16-$val9*$val36^2,10,black	text black,$val36-0.2,0.5*$val29,medium,x-$val19	text black,$val36+$val14-1,0.5*$val29,medium,x - $val7	text black,$val36+$val14+$val7-0.2,0.5*$val29,medium,x	dsegment $val36,0,$val36,$val16-$val9*$val36^2,black	dsegment $val36+$val14,0,$val36+$val14,$val16-$val9*$val36^2,black	dsegment $val36+$val19,0,$val36+$val19,$val16-$val9*$val36^2,black	
val48=\(g(x) = r(x)+$val14)
val49=\(g(x) = r(x+$val14))
val50=\(g(x) = r(x-$val14))
val51=\(g(x) = r(x)-$val14)
val52=<div class="wims_instruction">Calculer une valeur exacte. \(sqrt(2)) s'écrit	sqrt(2).</div>
val53=<p>Tu peux résoudre \(u(x) = 0) et pour cela te ramener à \((x - $val14 )^2 =	K).<br>	Ou te rappeler que pour \(g), la solution était $val41.</p>
val54=<p>Pour calculer l'image de \(x) par \(g)	on utilise l'image de \(x - $val14) par \(r).</p>	 \(g(x) = $val31 = $val35)<br>	\(g(x) = 0) équivaut à :	<ul class="wims_nopuce">	<li>\(-$val9*(x-$val14)^2+$val16 = 0)</li>	<li>\(-$val9*(x-$val14)^2 = -$val16)</li>	<li>\((x-$val14)^2 = $val39)</li>	<li>\(x-$val14 = -sqrt($val39)) ou \(x-$val14 = sqrt($val39))</li>	<li>\(x = $val14 - sqrt($val39)) ou \(x = $val14 + sqrt($val39))</li>	<li>Mais la solution cherchée ici est supérieure à $val14</li>	<li>donc c'est \(x = $val14 + sqrt($val39)).</li>	</ul>	
val55=<p>Pour calculer l'image de \(x) par \(u)	on utilise l'image de \(x - $val14 - $val7) par \(r).</p>	 \(u(x) = $val24 )<br>	\(u(x) = 0) équivaut à :	<ul class="wims_nopuce">	<li>\(-$val9*(x-$val19)^2+$val16 = 0)</li>	<li>\(-$val9*(x-$val19)^2 = -$val16)</li>	<li>\((x-$val19)^2 = $val39)</li>	<li>\(x-$val19 = -sqrt($val39)) ou \(x-$val19 = sqrt($val39))</li>	<li>\(x = $val19 - sqrt($val39)) ou \(x = $val19 + sqrt($val39))</li>	<li>Mais la solution cherchée ici est supérieure à $val19</li>	<li>donc c'est \(x = $val19 + sqrt($val39)).</li>	</ul>	
oefsteps=reply1	reply2	reply3	reply4,reply5 
nextstep=!nosubst reply1	reply2	reply3	reply4,reply5 
